    "  candidates: at least 2. text is the main line (person or film). subtext is optional (film, song credits, producers). Delete subtext if there isn't one.",
    "Each pick is saved as '<id>__<text lowercased, spaces removed>'. If you change a nominee's text after people vote, their pick for it stops counting.",
    "Replace every TODO. The importer won't accept a file with placeholders.",
    "Fields starting with '_' are ignored."
